[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-exchange 5...Bg4"]
[Name "Exchange: 6.Bb5+"]

6. Bb5+ { A check that develops the bishop. }
6... Nc6 { Blocks with a developing move. The bishop on g4 stays where it is doing a job. [%cal Gc6d4] }
7. h3 Bxf3 8. Qxf3 e6 { Guards d5. Black has a sound position with ...Bd6 and castling to come. } *
